        "TileImage": "$($repository d31a723a-f0a6-4b10-8bac-7ab496a7f095).Image",
        "Description": "Agent Munga!\r\rIt&apos;s good to be back in the Friday Night Streamorino. Today I completed my final college application! I am really excited as I expect responses from 8 universities. But!!!\r\rSome pinche jabronies raided the admissions offices of these colleges, and now they no longer have my file. They have ran off to Santa Fortuna in an attempt to escape, but I know that no one escapes Agent Munga.\r\rSo, just use my favorite fiber wire/molotov cocktail sandwich kill method combo and get er&apos; done!",
